72:[[],["$","$L3e",null,{"className":"case-jobs__arrival","children":["$","$L8f",null,{"headingLevel":3,"intro":["Three features run through the hub: friends, the multipliers and the weekly updates. Each has its own place: the Friends area, a week’s match, and a league’s page with Joined Leagues."],"jobs":[{"line":"In the header, on a player’s page and in Browse Leagues","media":{"id":"wage-fantasy-crypto-job-friends","type":"image","src":"/wage-fantasy-crypto/wall/friends.webp","alt":"Wage Fantasy Crypto’s Friends page: Friends current in the header beside Browse Leagues, Joined Leagues and Wallet, a search field at the top right, and a table of friends with how many leagues each is playing, their wins and their losses.","caption":"Friends area: the list of friends and the search above it.","provenance":"production","width":1080,"height":768,"aspectRatio":"1080 / 768"},"text":"Friends is one of the four areas in the header, next to Browse Leagues, Joined Leagues and Wallet, and its list of friends can be searched by name. A player’s page has an Add Friend button, and Browse Leagues has a Friend’s tab beside All, Upcoming and Featured.","title":"Friends across the hub"},{"line":"The week’s match, position by position, in Detailed Mode","media":{"id":"wage-fantasy-crypto-job-watch-league-general-division-match-opened-details-opened","type":"image","src":"/wage-fantasy-crypto/wall/watch-league-general-division-match-opened-details-opened.webp","alt":"A week’s match in Wage Fantasy Crypto, open over the league with Detailed Mode on: for each of the two players, marked Winner and Loser, a table of the positions with their coin, increase, multiplier and final value, and a total at the foot.","caption":"A week’s match with Detailed Mode on: each player’s table and its total.","provenance":"production","width":1080,"height":768,"aspectRatio":"1080 / 768"},"text":"A week’s match has a Detailed Mode switch. Turned on, it adds a Multiplier and a Final Value to every position, and a total under each player’s table.","title":"Multipliers in a match"},{"line":"A mark a week, and where each joined league stands","media":{"id":"wage-fantasy-crypto-job-joined-leagues-league-selected","type":"image","src":"/wage-fantasy-crypto/wall/joined-leagues-league-selected.webp","alt":"A league opened from Joined Leagues in Wage Fantasy Crypto: Withdraw Funds & Leave, the league’s terms in a strip, the prize bar, General Division before Playoffs, and the standings with a W, L or D for each player’s week and a clock on the week to come.","caption":"A league opened from Joined Leagues: each week’s marks and a clock on the week to come.","provenance":"production","width":1080,"height":768,"aspectRatio":"1080 / 768"},"text":"A league’s page gives every player a W, an L or a D for each week, with a clock on the week still to come, and arrows to step through the weeks. Joined Leagues lists every league a player is in, each with its score and its result: Playing, Winner or Loser.","title":"The season, week by week"}],"label":"Three features of the hub"}]}],[]]
